    <localTopics>
        <fullName>Gestionnaire_de_Brouillons_Email_16jAW0000003gxB</fullName>
        <canEscalate>false</canEscalate>
        <description>This topic handles the automatic generation of email draft responses 
for new customer cases created via Email-to-Case.</description>
        <developerName>Gestionnaire_de_Brouillons_Email_16jAW0000003gxB</developerName>
        <genAiPluginInstructions>
            <description>1. When you receive a CaseId, Subject and Description, 
   immediately call Generate Email Draft Action with :
   - CaseId : the Case ID received
   - caseSubject : the Case Subject received
   - caseDescription : the Case Description received

2. Once Generate Email Draft Action returns SelectedTemplate,
   immediately call Merge And Save Draft with :
   - CaseId : the Case ID received
   - TemplateName : the SelectedTemplate value returned

3. Never ask for confirmation.
4. Never ask for additional information.
5. Execute all steps immediately and automatically.
6. Once done, confirm the email draft has been generated.</description>
            <developerName>instruction_4</developerName>
            <language xsi:nil="true"/>
            <masterLabel>Instruction 4</masterLabel>
            <sortOrder>0</sortOrder>
        </genAiPluginInstructions>
